There are a lot of reasons why an app may execute differently on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> vs your personal workstation. A few off the top of my head are loaded libraries, character encoding, system dependencies, operating system differences, memory/cpu/network differences, etc. While we try to replicate your environment as close as possible, there will always be differences in the environment between your workstation and our servers.

Hope that helps.

