Hi Jason,
Your memories are partially correct.  Once the service moves out of Beta, the free tier will not support authenticated applications.  That would be a paid tier that you could consider if you were interested in hosting your application on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. The first paid tier to support authentication that would be the $99/month or $1100/year tier.

If you have any questions, please don't hesitate to drop me a line and we can discuss your needs offline.

-Tareef

